      },
      {
        "text": "Our ability to find information online is influenced by our vocabulary size.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "A lack of a word for a concept makes it difficult to understand that concept.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "English has a rich vocabulary due to borrowing from many other languages.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Some languages lack words for certain scientific concepts.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      },
      {
        "text": "People who speak languages without words for scientific concepts may be cognitively handicapped.",
        "confidence": 0.8
