      },
      {
        "text": "Each participant completed ten country-finding tasks in a survey.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "A cartogram was created based on the percentage of Americans unable to identify a country.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The cartogram visually distorts regions by the rate of identification failure among Americans.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Americans perform well in identifying the United States on a map.",
        "confidence": 0.92
