    "turn_text": "title. Yeah, well, again, it's amazing how little millennials and people in general know about sex education. And I ask a number of questions like, how many times should an IUD be inserted? And an alarming fraction of the public thinks every time you have sex. So obviously we are failing in some ways to get just basic information to our kids in this.",
