        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "All my surveys were conducted within a relatively short time frame.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "There has been significant change in science and technology over recent decades.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Historically, people like Socrates believed younger generations were less intelligent than older ones.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "If the perception that youth are becoming less intelligent were accurate, humanity would have an IQ comparable to that of a houseplant by now.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "The idea that younger generations are less knowledgeable than previous ones is a recurring theme throughout history.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      }
    ],
    "assumptions": [
